        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same pair sits in the venerable main-and-specialty pattern: Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable cultivated wood path as the primary, with painting path as his specialty. Fang Yuan can reflect wood path methods while remaining a stranger to painting path, which is why painting path methods still land on him in that fight.",
